        "LEARNING OUTCOMES — By the end of this lesson in Business Essentials, you should be able to explain the topic in your own words, recognise when it is useful, apply it to a realistic task and check whether the result is reliable. You should also be able to describe one limitation instead of assuming that one method works in every situation.",
