        "HOW TO APPLY THE KNOWLEDGE — Identify the customer need, test demand, estimate fixed and variable costs, set a realistic price, record transactions and compare actual results with assumptions before expanding. Record important inputs, decisions and checks. Separate verified facts from assumptions. If information is missing, write down what still needs checking rather than silently guessing. Finally, compare the result with the original task.",
