      "KEY TERMS — Community: people connected by place or interests; map key: symbols explained on a map; direction: position relative to a reference; right: protected entitlement; responsibility: duty; stakeholder: person or group affected. Build a glossary in your own notes. For each term, write a definition in your own words, an example and one related term it could be confused with. This helps you decide when a concept is appropriate and when it is not.",
