          "DETAILED EXPLANATION — Responsible AI use combines tool limitations with privacy, fairness, transparency and human oversight. Models can produce convincing but incorrect content and reflect gaps or bias in data. Users remain responsible for checking suitability and the consequences of decisions. Connect this explanation to “Introduction and Key Concepts”: ask what the concept helps you understand or decide, what information it depends on and how the outcome might change if an important condition changed. Define unfamiliar terms and add a small example so that understanding goes beyond memorising words.",
